== Wiki Organization Guidelines ==

These guidelines outline the improved organizational structure for BITwiki using Semantic MediaWiki and transclusion principles. BITwiki is designed to function as both a traditional knowledge base and a dynamic knowledge graph, connecting theoretical concepts to practical implementations through explicit semantic relationships.

